[00:08.275]
[00:12.035]PANGE, LINGUA, REDEMPTIO
[00:16.389]Saint Thomas Aquinas/Adam Gubman
[00:20.270]
[00:27.873]Oh Pange, oh pange lingua redemptio
[00:39.605]De meam carnem, carnem mysterium
[00:50.177]Sanguinisque pretiosi mei (Ahh)
[01:06.941]Praesertim, Quae, quae mi-hi imortale
[01:16.775]Oh fructus, oh fructus ventris generosi
[01:29.071]Rex effúdit géntium.
[01:33.946]
[01:42.055]Pange, lingua, redemptio!
[02:02.152]
[02:03.859]Tantum ergo sacraméntum
[02:15.090]Venerémur cérnui:
[02:26.235]Et antíquum documéntum
[02:39.683]Novo cedat rítui:
[02:50.232]Ad firmándum cor sincérum
[03:01.617]Sola fides súfficit.
[03:14.404]
[03:14.770]Pange, lingua, redemptio!
[03:30.788]